<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine posts $880.2 mln trade deficit Jan-July.</title>
<headline>Ukraine posts $880.2 mln trade deficit Jan-July.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $880.2 million in the first seven months of this year, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jun-July 96  Jun-July 95</p>
<p> Exports (bln $)		6.959	  5.777</p>
<p> Imports (bln $)		7.840	  5.738</p>
<p> Balance (million $)		-880.2	 +38.9</p>
<p>NOTE-Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with the former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $502.9 million. Trade with the rest of the world resulted in a deficit of $377.2 million.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
